# Environment of the agentic-rag capture (make fixtures-agentic-rag, #12).
#
# Only what arec1b0/agentic-rag's src/ imports at run time (loguru, openai, chromadb,
# sentence_transformers, pydantic, pydantic_settings, prometheus_client, numpy), not its whole
# requirements.txt, which also carries Jupyter, MLflow and dev tools. openai matches the
# fixtures and the shim's tests. Then the shim's own dependencies (sdk/python/pyproject.toml);
# the driver installs the shim and the app with --no-deps and runs `uv pip check`.
#
# Re-lock: uv pip compile tools/fixtures/agentic_rag/requirements.in --python-version 3.12 \
#   --torch-backend cpu --generate-hashes -o tools/fixtures/agentic_rag/requirements.lock
